  "howToCollect": "Two program systems, both server-rendered HTML (UTF-8), plain GET, no login/cookies needed: (1) 독서문화프로그램: list = GET https://www.unilib.dobong.kr/edusat/list.do?v_page={n}&sh_ct_idx={lib}&v_search=&v_keyword=&sh_edu_gubun=&sh_target_code=&sh_status= (20 items/page, newest first by edu_idx; hub page with per-library links: /contents.do?idx=107). sh_ct_idx codes: 2=도봉문화정보도서관, 3=도봉아이나라도서관, 4=학마을도서관, 5=도봉기적의도서관, 76=쌍문채움도서관, 84=원당마을한옥도서관, 7=둘리도서관, 83=김근태기념도서관, 8=공립작은도서관 (list label \"공립작은도서관 > {작은도서관명}\"), 77=통합사업 (joint events; venue taken from 강의실 field, e.g. 도봉구청 야외도서관). Optional filters: sh_status (0 접수준비, 1 접수중, 2 접수기간마감), sh_target_code (0 누구나, 1 유아, 2 어린이, 3 청소년, 4 성인, 5 어르신). Pagination: stop when a page has no item whose 운영기간 end >= today and all starts are old (we read 2–5 pages per library). Detail = GET /edusat/view.do?edu_idx={id} (prepage param optional). Fields are <dl><dt>label</dt><dd>value</dd> inside div.table_bview: 강좌기간 (programStart~End), 강좌시간 (schedule), 접수기간 (applyStart~End, with HH:MM), 수강대상 (target), 모집인원 (\"{applied} / {capacity} (선착순)\" or \"{capacity} 명 (방문접수)\"), 강의실, 참가비, 강사. Status label = a/span.btn_sm inside div.title (접수준비/접수중/접수마감/대기접수/기간종료/확인불가). Body text is div.content (often mostly a poster image). (2) 문화교실 (paid courses, only 도봉문화정보도서관 ct=2 and 도봉아이나라도서관 ct=3): list GET /edusat2/list.do?v_page={n}&sh_ct_idx={2|3}, detail GET /edusat2/view.do?edu_idx={id}; same markup, but 강좌기간 dd also repeats the time. Quirks: titles contain literal unescaped \"<...>\" Korean text (e.g. <오싹오싹 ...>), so strip only real HTML tags; inline <span>/<b> tags split words, remove them without inserting spaces. Dates on the site are already YYYY-MM-DD with year (no inference needed); one older list item showed an invalid date \"2025-11-31\". Facility addresses (찾아오시는길 /contents.do?idx=450,455,460,465,470,475,480,485; main.do address boxes) are road addresses without 동 names, so area is null for all. Selection: children/family targets only, programEnd >= 2026-10-13; 40 kept (cap). Eligible but left out for the cap: 5917, 5856, 6215, 6060 (original posting of 6274), 5968/5867/5825 (K-POP 댄스 동아리 꿈틀), 5721, 5783 (도봉구청 행복작은도서관), 6178/6188/6190 (영어성장기), 6269 (초등~성인 2인 팀), edusat2 915. applyMethod = the site label in 모집인원 parentheses; category = site menu name (독서문화프로그램 / 문화교실). ageTags: \"36개월 이상\"/\"37개월~7세\" treated as preschool, not infant.",
